# Kind names are case-sensitive, like all keywords.
mode: check
schema: t(customerId: string, month: datetime, revenue: real, n: long)
---- query
from t
| render TimeChart
---- expected
error[DS5003]: unknown chart kind `TimeChart`
  --> query:2:10
  |
2 | | render TimeChart
  |          ^^^^^^^^^ not a chart kind
  |
  = help: a chart kind with a similar name exists: `timechart`
  = note: the chart kinds are table, timechart, linechart, areachart, barchart, columnchart, piechart, scatterchart, card
